      },
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm in favor of getting rid of the \"curated\" fallbacks, because I absolutely hate looking at brushies, wine bottles and the other silly ones & such. I'd much rather impostors stay, let us make fallbacks for specific avatars instead of a fallback to rule them all. Nothing like seeing an awtter, show their avatar and their a half million polygon e-human. What if they could make a nice simplified fallback for that specific avi, if that avi doesn't have a fallback, use the impostor.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
