  "details": "Please don't do that. Imposters are nice, but a lot of us enjoy having the novelty of creating nicer, more professional looking avatars. A lot of us have already spent hours of time making them.\n\nIf anything, make it a VRC+ feature, to allow users to upload their own custom \"imposter\" avatars, aka fallbacks, within performance limitations.",
